<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Nov wholesale prices up 13.23 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Nov wholesale prices up 13.23 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 13.23 percent in November year-on-year, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bureau, disclosing the wholesale price index for the first time in more than a year, gave no comparative figures.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, rose 2.38 percent to 196.79 in November from 192.21 in October. The index stood at 173.8 in November 1995.</p>
<p>					  Nov	Oct	   Nov 1995</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICE  base 1990/91  196.79   192.21	  173.80</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  +2.38    n/a		n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +13.23    n/a		n/a</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
